    "raw_html": "<div id=\"question-135433\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">5.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1913#9180\">Finding the Steady-State Vector of a Stochastic 3x3 Matrix</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"135433\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>A study has recorded and analyzed the results of the parliamentary elections of a particular country, held every four years. The study shows how voter preference changes from one political party to another. The table below shows the results of this study.</p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; border-top:hidden; border-right:hidden\">From:</td> \n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td></td>\n<td width=\"75\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Yellow Party</b></td>\n<td width=\"75\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Blue Party</b></td> \n<td width=\"75\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Red Party</b></td> \n</tr>\n<tr> \n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; border-left:hidden; border-bottom:hidden\">To:</td>\n<td width=\"75\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Yellow Party</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"103\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.7</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-contain